# Contributor: Hannes Janetzek <hannes.janetzek@gmail.com>
# plugdata: Pure Data with a JUCE GUI (pd-else, cyclone and more included), as a standalone program and as LV2 plugins (plugdata, plugdata-fx). Meant as a GUI for zynthian's Pd patches later. QUICK_BUILD: without sfizz, ffmpeg and Gem for now.
# JUCE and the other git submodules are extra sources (nura/tools/gh-submodule-sources.py). LV2
# only. The plugin has its JUCE GUI built in, so it needs X11 and freetype headers to build (JUCE
# loads X11 only when the editor opens).
# libxi-dev, libxcomposite-dev: its JUCE fork includes XInput2.h and Xcomposite.h.
pkgname=plugdata
pkgver=0.9.3.2
pkgrel=0
_commit=49aa12ba90548bda319f48ebe34c588e5f481b19
